'''The 2014 United States House of Representatives elections''' will be held on November 4, 2014. Elections will be held for all 435 seats, representing the 50 [[U.S. state]]s. Elections will also be held for the [[Delegate (United States Congress)|non-voting delegates]] from the [[District of Columbia]] and four of the five [[Insular area|U.S. territories]].

The winners of these elections will serve in the [[114th United States Congress]], with seats apportioned among the states based on the [[2010 United States Census]].

