== Separate elections ==

Four special elections will be held in 2014.

* Two elections will be held concurrent with the November elections. The winners will have a [[List of current members of the United States House of Representatives by seniority|seniority advantage]] over other freshmen, as their seniority starts on the day of the elections.

*Two elections will be held separate from the November general elections, as follows:

